# The inverse functions at 16 digits, where the host's maths library decides the last digit
# (`docs/design/decisions.md`): one file per host, named for it. These answers are interrexx's on
# macOS, recorded on a CI runner; the oracle has not been run there.
eval digits=9
RxCalcArcSin(.5,16)
RxCalcArcCos(0.5,16)
----
30.00000000000000
59.99999999999999
